    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384820/extras/d460f423bcaf9abc115a0010de38b09d.poster.avif?t=1749555451\" width=616 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384820/extras/d460f423bcaf9abc115a0010de38b09d.webm?t=1749555451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384820/extras/d460f423bcaf9abc115a0010de38b09d.mp4?t=1749555451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The Story</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your first day as an apprentice at the Nytheris Archive, you accidentally unleash an ancient force that was meant to stay sealed forever... Classic intern mistake! Now, with the world teetering on the brink, it's up to you to piece together the remnants of a shattered relic and set things right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>What's it all about?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broken Relic</strong> is a pixel-art fantasy comedy point-and-click adventure.\u00a0 Did you enjoy classic LucasArts and Sierra adventures? Ever wondered what would happen if you mixed Discworld with Simon the Sorcerer and Monkey Island? Do you like clever puzzles and silly jokes? Then we have the game for you! Day of the Tent... no no, <strong>Broken Relic</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Give me the bulletpoints!</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You point, You click, things happen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced dialog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Intuitive gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy! Comedy! Magic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No deaths!\u00a0 No fail states! No pixel hunting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a demo, you could just play it and check for yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo covers full Act 1 of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384820/extras/4743732914325dc3f2903bbc223f0bc7.poster.avif?t=1749555451\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384820/extras/4743732914325dc3f2903bbc223f0bc7.webm?t=1749555451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384820/extras/4743732914325dc3f2903bbc223f0bc7.mp4?t=1749555451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384820/extras/d460f423bcaf9abc115a0010de38b09d.poster.avif?t=1749555451\" width=616 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384820/extras/d460f423bcaf9abc115a0010de38b09d.webm?t=1749555451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384820/extras/d460f423bcaf9abc115a0010de38b09d.mp4?t=1749555451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The Story</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your first day as an apprentice at the Nytheris Archive, you accidentally unleash an ancient force that was meant to stay sealed forever... Classic intern mistake! Now, with the world teetering on the brink, it's up to you to piece together the remnants of a shattered relic and set things right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>What's it all about?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broken Relic</strong> is a pixel-art fantasy comedy point-and-click adventure.\u00a0 Did you enjoy classic LucasArts and Sierra adventures? Ever wondered what would happen if you mixed Discworld with Simon the Sorcerer and Monkey Island? Do you like clever puzzles and silly jokes? Then we have the game for you! Day of the Tent... no no, <strong>Broken Relic</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Give me the bulletpoints!</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You point, You click, things happen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced dialog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Intuitive gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy! Comedy! Magic!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No deaths!\u00a0 No fail states! No pixel hunting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a demo, you could just play it and check for yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo covers full Act 1 of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384820/extras/4743732914325dc3f2903bbc223f0bc7.poster.avif?t=1749555451\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384820/extras/4743732914325dc3f2903bbc223f0bc7.webm?t=1749555451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384820/extras/4743732914325dc3f2903bbc223f0bc7.mp4?t=1749555451\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
